# $capability_id Result Contract

## Purpose

Define the metadata-only result shape expected from the scaffolded capability
contract. This is documentation, not an execution implementation.

## Required Fields

- `capability_id`
- `metadata_only`
- `accepted`
- `rejection_reason`
- `output_file_names`
- `forbidden_boundaries`

## Deterministic Rejection Reasons

$rejection_reasons

## Fail-Closed Policy

- Missing metadata-only authority returns `metadata_only_boundary_missing`.
- Any forbidden boundary returns `forbidden_boundary_requested`.
- Non-contract output requests return `non_contract_output_requested`.
- Unsafe scaffold mutation requests return `unsafe_template_mutation_requested`.
